# Pandora's box on NoahGroundF ($63): the $39 object LoadSpritesInLevel
# puts at $210,$D8 while $C745 is clear, with $2E = $035 -- ObjType_Events
# $35 (loc_E0BE). A on it is $171A; the next idle visit sets $C745,
# event_flags = $B00 and screen_changed_flag, and the level loads again
# where the party stood. loc_7E02 case $B (loc_7FF2) then clears $E400 --
# no party on screen -- and runs ObjType_Events $36 (loc_E0F8) through
# the $DE70 path with no button: $1910 in the big box, then Dark Force
# ($102). Before build 63, A on the box was the plain \"nothing unusual\"
# line and "level: A on object type 0 index $35 is not ported".

start level $63 33 14
wait idle
press up                     # the box stops the step; he turns to it
wait idle
shot 01_facing_the_box
press a
wait idle                    # stopped at the {pause}
expect script $171A
shot 02_dark_power
press c
wait idle                    # the {end:C4}
press c
wait idle                    # the reload, fade and all, and $1910 to its {pause}
expect screen level
expect level $63 33 14
expect script $1910
shot 03_no_party_big_box
press c
wait screen battle
expect screen battle
wait idle                    # FIGHT/STGY: Dark Force in, no enemy boxes
shot 04_dark_force
expect no-stderr not ported
